13:["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6 max-w-[640px] space-y-4 text-[15.5px] leading-[1.7] text-slate","children":[["$","p","Every serious RP server eventual",{"children":"Every serious RP server eventually hits the same wall: you need a FiveM graphic designer, and the good ones are booked, the cheap ones disappear mid-project, and your launch date will not move. Neva Design works like an art department that answers instantly. You describe what your city needs — a crest for city hall, a loading screen that sets the mood, a Discord banner for allowlist applications — and the AI composes a publish-ready visual you can refine until it fits, then export at up to 8K. No design software, no back-and-forth emails spread over two weeks. The public portfolio at /neva-design shows real server packs, esports logos and GTA RP posters, so you can judge the output before spending anything. Signing up is free with no credit card, so you can explore the studio before choosing a plan."}]]}]
14:["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"href":"/#generative","className":"pv-btn","children":["Sign up for free",["$","$L11",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$a:props:children:0:1:props:children:1:props:children:1:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","size":15,"strokeWidth":1.8}]]}],["$","$L7",null,{"href":"/neva-design","className":"pv-btn pv-btn--ghost","children":"See the portfolio"}]]}]
15:["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-14 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 md:grid-cols-4","children":[["$","figure","/postergrandfivem2.webp",{"className":"pv-print relative overflow-hidden aspect-[3/4]","children":["$","$L23",null,{"src":"/postergrandfivem2.webp","alt":"Affiche grand format pour serveur FiveM","fill":true,"sizes":"(max-width: 768px) 46vw, 250px","className":"object-cover"}]}],["$","figure","/Prime_-_preview_serveur_pack_8.webp",{"className":"pv-print relative overflow-hidden aspect-[16/9]","children":["$","$L23",null,{"src":"/Prime_-_preview_serveur_pack_8.webp","alt":"Pack graphique complet de serveur RP","fill":true,"sizes":"(max-width: 768px) 46vw, 250px","className":"object-cover"}]}],["$","figure","/affiche3.webp",{"className":"pv-print relative overflow-hidden aspect-[3/4]","children":["$","$L23",null,{"src":"/affiche3.webp","alt":"Identité visuelle de serveur GTA RP","fill":true,"sizes":"(max-width: 768px) 46vw, 250px","className":"object-cover"}]}],["$","figure","/neva-design/logos/EFINAL.webp",{"className":"pv-print relative overflow-hidden aspect-[16/9]","children":["$","$L23",null,{"src":"/neva-design/logos/EFINAL.webp","alt":"Emblème esport E Final","fill":true,"sizes":"(max-width: 768px) 46vw, 250px","className":"object-cover"}]}]]}]
16:["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-16 max-w-[680px]","children":[["$","section","How the workflow actually feels",{"className":"mt-12 first:mt-0","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-[clamp(24px,2.4vw,32px)] font-light leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.01em] text-ink","children":"How the workflow actually feels"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-4 text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-slate","children":[["$","p","You write a plain-language brief",{"children":"You write a plain-language brief: the city’s era, the mood, two or three colors, anything you want echoed from servers you admire. A first proposal lands in minutes. Then you iterate by talking — \"darker sky\", \"thinner typeface\", \"drop the gold trim\" — through the conversational Creative Director, which behaves like an art director who never sleeps and never bills per revision. Iterations are unlimited within your plan’s quota, so exploring a second direction costs nothing but a sentence. When a visual is right, you export it at full resolution, up to 8K, ready for Discord, your community site or a trailer."}]]}]]}],["$","section","What RP communities actually ship with it",{"className":"mt-12 first:mt-0","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-[clamp(24px,2.4vw,32px)] font-light leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.01em] text-ink","children":"What RP communities actually ship with it"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-4 text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-slate","children":[["$","p","The typical launch list: a city ",{"children":"The typical launch list: a city crest or emblem scaled down to a Discord icon, one or two 1920 × 1080 loading screens that hold up while resources download, the server banner and invite splash, posters for the opening event and whitelist announcements, staff recruitment visuals, and thumbnails for the YouTube trailer. Established servers come back for seasonal art — a winter version of the loading screen, an election poster, a PD recruitment drive. Because everything derives from one brand kit, week twelve still looks like week one."}]]}]]}],["$","section","Getting results that read as professional",{"className":"mt-12 first:mt-0","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-[clamp(24px,2.4vw,32px)] font-light leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.01em] text-ink","children":"Getting results that read as professional"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-4 text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-slate","children":[["$","p","Three habits separate polished s",{"children":"Three habits separate polished servers from improvised ones. First, test every logo at 128 pixels; if it dies as a Discord icon, simplify before you build anything on top of it. Second, lock one palette and reuse the exact brief wording for every new piece — drift happens one visual at a time. Third, keep live data out of the art: connect info, player counts and rule lists change weekly, and baked-in text ages your visuals fast. Put the mood in the image and the facts in your channels."}]]}]]}]]}]
